        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e518e00e-e16d-3bfb-a584-7166220ae052",
                "word": "imperfection",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d6bbd17f-81aa-4a29-8ebb-ad04b5019d33",
                        "entry_id": "e518e00e-e16d-3bfb-a584-7166220ae052",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "imperfections"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "51530224-1e96-36a2-a87b-c4808699cd92",
                        "entry_id": "e518e00e-e16d-3bfb-a584-7166220ae052",
                        "glosses": [
                            "État de ce qui n’est pas parfait, achevé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5af88350-c4f9-4890-99be-d7f24ffcbc7f",
                                "sense_id": "51530224-1e96-36a2-a87b-c4808699cd92",
                                "text": "La plupart des gens en prennent leur parti malgré les imperfections sociales dont ils souffrent, et traitent de rêveurs et d’utopistes ceux qui prévoient les changements et travaillent à en hâter la réalisation."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2ea02a46-47c0-36d4-bbe5-6c6b6079ad17",
                        "entry_id": "e518e00e-e16d-3bfb-a584-7166220ae052",
                        "glosses": [
                            "État d’une personne ou d’une chose qui n’est pas parfaite."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0672056e-79c0-4380-bbc4-f9315fd86da4",
                                "sense_id": "2ea02a46-47c0-36d4-bbe5-6c6b6079ad17",
                                "text": "... il est certain que, puisque faillir et se tromper est une espèce d’imperfection ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e792fba-8bc4-425f-bc10-5a48cfad346a",
                                "sense_id": "2ea02a46-47c0-36d4-bbe5-6c6b6079ad17",
                                "text": "Parfois, cependant, il s’émeut, il s’attendrit et il maudit l’imperfection de sa nature qui ne lui permet pas les sensations multiples, il regrette de n’être qu’un homme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7fefbe4-16d8-4840-95f2-2c15efcb4737",
                                "sense_id": "2ea02a46-47c0-36d4-bbe5-6c6b6079ad17",
                                "text": "De son côté, la machine analyse sur 360° la pomme de terre et détecte instantanément la moindre imperfection comme les traces de vert parfois presque invisibles pour l’œil humain."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c3a6c3a2-9248-4aa3-a829-8b5d49d50ff8",
                        "source_entry_id": "e518e00e-e16d-3bfb-a584-7166220ae052",
                        "target_lang_word": "Fehler",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Fehler",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "277e11a9-90f2-314b-9053-bd9c2d60acfb",
                                        "entry_id": "de17888c-9066-3800-bb62-1fe59e436e00",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abweichung von einem optimalen Zustand, Verfahren oder dem Richtigen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7f722ac-3e95-4d66-8f12-90927d19773b",
                                                "sense_id": "277e11a9-90f2-314b-9053-bd9c2d60acfb",
                                                "text": "In der Physikarbeit hat er drei Fehler gemacht."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e0c22fd-cd74-380d-9d3f-5ce46f877844",
                                        "entry_id": "de17888c-9066-3800-bb62-1fe59e436e00",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine schadhafte Stelle, eine Stelle mit einem Mangel"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f64d8ec9-722d-4ec9-9f0e-8a96274e9e93",
                                                "sense_id": "6e0c22fd-cd74-380d-9d3f-5ce46f877844",
                                                "text": "Der Stoff hat einen Fehler im Material."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5106ca67-2ecc-39ea-956a-5a6afc7e2c2c",
                                        "entry_id": "de17888c-9066-3800-bb62-1fe59e436e00",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine falsche Entscheidung, eine falsche Handlung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4410f83a-23f9-4918-88eb-f249865372e5",
                                                "sense_id": "5106ca67-2ecc-39ea-956a-5a6afc7e2c2c",
                                                "text": "Diese Entscheidung ist ein schwerer Fehler."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d44082a9-8fd6-4862-a686-b6aaaa6033c9",
                                                "sense_id": "5106ca67-2ecc-39ea-956a-5a6afc7e2c2c",
                                                "text": "Das ist nicht mein Fehler."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31340048-9a0d-4f17-8377-5e9c4d3b069d",
                                                "sense_id": "5106ca67-2ecc-39ea-956a-5a6afc7e2c2c",
                                                "text": "„Jeder verheiratete Mann sollte seine Fehler vergessen – es nützt nichts, wenn zwei Menschen sich an dieselbe Sache erinnern.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b96beb14-5f46-30c2-80fb-5d2532ca57be",
                                        "entry_id": "de17888c-9066-3800-bb62-1fe59e436e00",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine körperliche oder charakterliche Schwäche"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc532984-24c1-4637-90fb-26b15b35ca7e",
                                                "sense_id": "b96beb14-5f46-30c2-80fb-5d2532ca57be",
                                                "text": "Jeder Mensch hat so seine Fehler."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "191a5f87-6159-4b3f-98c5-c8f287c9ec60",
                        "source_entry_id": "e518e00e-e16d-3bfb-a584-7166220ae052",
                        "target_lang_word": "imperfection",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "imperfection",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "43f2ad4b-864b-39a0-a708-02d214067359",
                                        "entry_id": "ef043c0f-2aee-3e3b-8664-3498c680e98f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Those qualities or features that are imperfect; the characteristic, state, or quality of being imperfect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e867e530-d857-4eb2-9af6-db71c6f7822f",
                                                "sense_id": "43f2ad4b-864b-39a0-a708-02d214067359",
                                                "text": "You can accept your imperfection or try to improve."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eed1b654-599c-4284-b66c-4114162ee3dc",
                                                "sense_id": "43f2ad4b-864b-39a0-a708-02d214067359",
                                                "text": "And for the first time she realised what it was to escape from the smallish perfection of England, into the grander imperfection of a great continent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d2ce7f87-97b5-35b3-b30d-656f97a8c823",
                                        "entry_id": "ef043c0f-2aee-3e3b-8664-3498c680e98f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that makes something else less than perfect; a blemish, impurity, error, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6601c29c-5216-49a2-a0a1-5b146aa643e7",
                                                "sense_id": "d2ce7f87-97b5-35b3-b30d-656f97a8c823",
                                                "text": "He loves me despite my imperfections."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e32b127e-195b-42a4-82c6-fd1bdf1a0b94",
                                                "sense_id": "d2ce7f87-97b5-35b3-b30d-656f97a8c823",
                                                "text": "It will be sufficient for me if I discover many beauties or imperfections which others have not attended to; and I should be very glad to see one of our eminent writers publish their discoveries on the same subject."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "997cc9e9-678c-4dda-97c6-0b62d8933e62",
                                                "sense_id": "d2ce7f87-97b5-35b3-b30d-656f97a8c823",
                                                "text": "Notice that cleavage has nothing to do with imperfections in the crystal. Indeed, if you try cleaving an imperfect crystal, you may find that it cannot be cleaved as well as a perfect one. The cleavage is the result of the orderliness of the atomic arrangement. No wonder imperfections, which disturb the orderliness, disturb the cleavage as well. You will also note that the cleavage directions are obedient to the symmetry of the crystal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6132d90c-0ca9-4f40-ab0b-abb7884eb089",
